<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>We jus Press E</Major>
    <Description>There are countless of games on ROBLOX that require you to spam E for skills, achievments, what ever it is. This macro is just for anyone that is too lazy, or actually has a life and cant waste it pressing E for a hour straight. This macro allows you leave the room while still pressing e, getting that annoying achievement or item. It simply presses E continiously, up untill you deactive it.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 1 s
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 1 s</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>